SYS_C0012085 Check CHANGE_TYPE in ('ADD','UPDATE','DELETE')
This is a strict rule on your **JOURNAL_LOG** table. It says that the database will instantly reject any insert if the CHANGE_TYPE column is not exactly "ADD", "UPDATE", or "DELETE".
Now, look at how we are calling the logAudit method in your Java backend (JournalRequestServiceImpl.java):
